{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_05_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7aca20e4c92e073da30af3ae569c891010727b9e384cdcaae49bac06a06a2216",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f6f97a192863820d732f42e39682f38faebc07ffccd6e662eafe7414516468c",
      "text": "为什么唯独交给我们彩的信件，会这么古旧\n破烂呢？其他事务所的可不是这样吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:214fa1aa958cd7b04975cd4da18c3d19805ad2cfd59cc5c272902308af5919cc",
      "text": "嗯。虽然我也像“速度部门”时那样，\n跟工作人员确认过有没有搞错……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01084bcd3294d47ad38e0b9365ce273399d51699fbc67c230fd6a0c01dbe0b6d",
      "text": "对方说是“没错的”对吧？\n哼……可疑的事情还真是一桩接一桩呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:969ce5e29585a93732eae4e7d6e3e616c81c6535b606d3133b7a2049de484ca8",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君！\n那边有特产店喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0726c0e191cc798fa5c7e3ff49e758b040a593d1823c7e3521b190c3290d9317",
      "text": "哎呀，真不错呢♪\n稍微顺路去看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7e990dfbf928291cab04e231351101612ddf3aeb5e3699914dfb6da13b3a2c0",
      "text": "也想给事务所的大家买点伴手礼呢。\n●●●●プロデューサー酱，我们走吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5331488a28c72c4c4f289c4c0d9a231d3e92a78f2f94378bbc8b6a727b76230c",
      "text": "挑选特产也完全是为了工作对吧？\n可不能太得意忘形……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5eb4fffbc96ca7638f1bf03bd0693fe6e44e64675b843aaac8dec6357b21501",
      "text": "嘴上这么说，九郎酱。自己故乡的镰仓\n能被大家感兴趣，高兴的心情完全藏不住呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b87305c5c2a9ad6aeb814c78efb2ba572acfd6d58112926fad91c146817fc9b3",
      "text": "话虽如此，\n刚才不也陪我们一路逛吃过来了嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad515753e956c105db5c1bbfc627821ee3b9cf9b9f271cffeb14aa2fb9c358ec",
      "text": "好吃的仙贝店和冰淇淋店，\n也都是九郎君告诉我们的喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7725df113ce527b5e1d73b8bd575632db0905dafe411bb6e96f679ec496bbfea",
      "text": "那、那纯粹只是为了让大家\n加深对这片土地的理解……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5010ca1aa49521688e25597dc2c1676bbb90f5c07255f8df7d7f06dbae8c4ac",
      "text": "不过，给事务所的大家买特产这件事我还是\n赞成的。那家店的话就由我来带路吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
